<title>AUSTRIA: QATARI OIL MINISTER ARRIVES FOR OPEC MEETING.</title>
<headline>QATARI OIL MINISTER ARRIVES FOR OPEC MEETING.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatari oil minister Abdullah bin Hamad al-Attiyah said on Tuesday he would support a rollover of OPEC's current 25.03 million barrels per day ceiling.</p>
<p>&quot;We will support a rollover. This is the only solution we can reach,&quot; he told reporters on arrival in Vienna.</p>
<p>OPEC's summer conference is scheduled to start at 1400 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
